WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.860
Well, the administration will abide by the ruling insofar as it affects the covered parties,

00:06.140 --> 00:13.800
but there are also many other options the president has to deploy federal resources and assets out of the U.S. military to Portland.

00:13.800 --> 00:20.020
But I was making the point that under federal law, Section Title 10 of the U.S. Code,

00:20.760 --> 00:26.160
the president has the authority anytime he believes federal resources are insufficient to federalize the National Guard

00:26.160 --> 00:29.420
to carry out a mission necessary for public safety.

00:29.420 --> 00:36.000
So it's important to understand that in Portland, ICE officers have been subjected to over 100 nights of terrorist assault,

00:36.500 --> 00:44.760
doxing, murder threats, violent attack, and every other means imaginable to try to overturn the results of the last election through violence.

00:44.940 --> 00:50.920
The most important point I want to make today is that the number one and two items in the GOP platform in 2024

00:50.920 --> 00:55.780
were to turn back the border invasion and carry out the largest deportation program in American history.

00:55.780 --> 01:02.840
Since inauguration day, there's been an orchestrated campaign of terrorism and violence against ICE officers.

01:02.980 --> 01:06.100
Of course, we saw the recent sniper attack against ICE officers.

01:06.440 --> 01:08.260
They're publishing their family's photos online.

01:08.360 --> 01:09.980
They're threatening them with murder or threatening with death,

01:10.080 --> 01:13.260
and they're physically attacking them in the street each and every day.

01:13.260 --> 01:19.340
And yet, shamefully, the mayor and governor in Portland and Oregon have refused to render aid,

01:19.700 --> 01:24.020
leaving ICE officers to street fight every single night against these terrorists.

01:24.520 --> 01:29.560
You make the claim of terrorist assaults and violence attack over 100 nights,

01:29.640 --> 01:35.040
and yet the judge overseeing this case says that that's untethered from reality.

01:35.040 --> 01:39.700
And local officials on the ground say that Trump's assertion of what's happening is in Portland,

01:39.840 --> 01:43.440
that it's war ravaged and burning to the ground, is far from true.

01:43.820 --> 01:50.260
I looked at the police data, and police have made something like 70 total arrests since June,

01:50.260 --> 01:53.100
and there are no reports of buildings being burned to the ground.

01:53.680 --> 01:59.140
The White House cited a guillotine being rolled out as a public display of rebellion.

01:59.140 --> 02:04.680
But there isn't actually a threat that these demonstrators are going to overthrow the government.

02:04.860 --> 02:08.760
Are you concerned that that response weakens your legal argument?

